{%- comment -%}
  Cart icon bubble (section wrapper)
  ----------------------------------
  Thin section wrapper around the existing snippets/cart-icon-bubble.liquid
  snippet so the Shopify Section Rendering API can target it by section id.

  /cart/add.js and /cart/change.js are called from assets/cart.js with
  `sections=cart-icon-bubble,cart-drawer`. The response is keyed by section
  id, which must resolve to a real file under /sections/. Rendering the
  snippet here keeps markup in a single place while giving the API a
  section to return.

  tag: null so Shopify doesn't wrap the bubble in its own element - the
  header button already provides the parent.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- render 'cart-icon-bubble' -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Cart icon bubble",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
